        "markdown": "[Villas](/villas) · [Services](/services) · [About](/about) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# St Barth Blue Villas\n\n## Hand-picked villas with ocean views, booked directly with the people who know them.\n\nWe are a boutique agency founded in 2009 by Caroline Mercier. Every villa in our portfolio has been visited by our team, and we meet every guest at the airport.\n\n## Featured villas\n\n- Villa Azur, 4 bedrooms, Pointe Milou — from USD 1,800 per night\n- Villa Mango, 2 bedrooms, Saint-Jean — from USD 950 per night\n- Villa Sunset, 6 bedrooms, Gouverneur — from USD 4,500 per night\n\nRates exclude the 5% tourist tax. Minimum stay 5 nights, 7 nights over the holidays.\n\n## Included with every stay\n\n- Airport meet and greet\n- Daily housekeeping (except Sundays)\n- Welcome groceries\n- 24/7 concierge line\n\n## What our guests say\n\n\"Caroline's team handled everything, from the boat day to the babysitter.\" — The Harrisons, London\n\n## Contact\n\nSt Barth Blue Villas, Rue de la Paix, Gustavia 97133\nOffice hours Monday to Friday 9am–5pm, Saturday 9am–1pm.\n+590 590 00 28 90 · stay@stbarthbluevillas.example\n\nWe speak English, French and Portuguese.\n\n© St Barth Blue Villas · Terms · Privacy"
